<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
	<meta charset="utf-8">
	<link rel="shortcut icon" href="https://stealthbits.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/sb-favicon.png">	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
	<title>Stealthbits</title>
	<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
	<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
	<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:ital,wght@0,100;0,300;0,400;0,500;0,700;0,900;1,100;1,300;1,400;1,500;1,700;1,900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
	<style>
		body{
			background-color: #1d1d1d;
			margin: 0;
			padding: 0;
			font-family: "Roboto", sans-serif;
		}
		.header{
			height: 100px;
			max-width: 1498px;
			margin: 0 auto;
			display: flex;
    		align-items: center;
    		padding: 0 20px;

		}
		.main-container{
			padding: 85px 20px 0;
			background: linear-gradient(90deg,#1f9dce, #48e4c3);;
			min-height: calc(100vh - 175px);
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: center;
		}
		.main-heading{
			font-weight: 500;
			font-size: 67px;
			margin: 0 auto 85px;
			color: #fff;
			text-align: center;
		}
		.main-heading span{
			display: block;
			font-size: 24px;
			font-weight: 400;
			margin-top: 14px;
		}
		.main-heading span a{
			text-decoration: underline;
			font-size: 24px;
			font-weight: 600;
			color: #fff;
			text-align: center;
		}
		.tile-list{
			max-width: 996px;
			margin: 0 auto;
			padding: 0;
			list-style: none;
			display: flex;
    		flex-wrap: wrap;
    		align-items: stretch;
    		justify-content: center;
			gap: 20px;
			margin-bottom: 120px;
		}
		.tile-list li{
			box-sizing: border-box;
			background: #fff;
			flex-basis: calc(50% - 10px);
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: flex-start;
			flex-direction: column;
			padding: 48px 24px;
			text-align: center;
			border-radius: 6px;
		}
		.tile-list li h3{
			font-size: 24px;
			font-weight: 500;
			color: #354556;
			margin:0;
		}
		.tile-list li p{
			font-size: 16px;
			font-weight: 400;
			color: #354556;
			margin: 20px 0 0;
		    line-height: 28px;
		    min-height: 96px;
			max-width: 410px;
		}
		.tile-list li a{
			color: #0a74e4;
			text-wrap: nowrap;
		}

		@media (min-width: 1241px) and (max-width:1598px ){
			.main-heading{
				font-size: 56px;
			}
			.header{
				max-width:967px ;
			}
		}
		@media only screen and (max-width: 1240px) {
			.tile-list{
				max-width: 742px;
			}
			.main-heading{
				font-size: 40px;
			}
			.header{
				justify-content: center;
			}
		}
		@media only screen and (max-width: 899px) {
			.tile-list li h3{
				font-size: 20px;
			}
			.tile-list li p{
				font-size: 14px;
			}
			.main-heading{
				font-size: 36px;
    			max-width: 496px;
			}
		}
		@media only screen and (max-width: 767px) {

			.main-heading span, .main-heading span a{
				font-size: 18px;
			}
			.tile-list li{
				flex-basis:100%
			}
		}
	</style>
</head>
<body>
	<div class="header">

		<a href="https://netwrix.com"><img src="data:image/png;base64," height="44" alt="Stealthbits logo"></a>
	</div>
	<div class="main-container">

		<h1 class="main-heading">Stealthbits is now part of Netwrix!<span>Please visit <a href="https://www.netwrix.com">netwrix.com</a> to find:</span></h1>
		<ul class="tile-list">
			<li>
				<h3>Product information</h3>
				<p>
					Stealthbits products are now available as
					<a href="https://www.netwrix.com/enterprise-auditor.html">Netwrix Enterprise Auditor</a>,
					<a href="https://www.netwrix.com/threat_detection_software.html">Netwrix Threat Manager</a>,
					<a href="https://www.netwrix.com/privilege_secure.html">Netwrix Privilege Secure</a>,
					<a href="https://www.netwrix.com/threat-prevention.html">Netwrix Threat Prevention</a>, and
					<a href="https://www.netwrix.com/active_directory_recovery_software.html">Netwrix Recovery for Active Directory</a>.
					For comprehensive data, identity and infrastructure security, check out the <a href="https://www.netwrix.com/solutions.html">Netwrix solutions</a> page.
				</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<h3>Support and documentation</h3>
				<p>To get technical support, explore product documentation, or access the Netwrix knowledgebase, please visit the <a href="https://www.netwrix.com/support.html"> Netwrix Support Portal</a>.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<h3>Information for resellers</h3>
				<p>To become a reseller of Netwrix solutions, <a href="https://www.netwrix.com/netwrix_partner_program.html">partner with us</a>! If you are already a partner and want to add Stealthbits products to your portfolio, simply reach out to your Netwrix contact.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<h3>Information about the merger</h3>
				<p>To learn more about Stealthbits becoming part of Netwrix, read the <a href="https://www.netwrix.com/netwrix_stealthbits_merge_to_address_demand_for_data_protection.html">press release.</a></p>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</div>
</body>
</html>
